/* Gn004 - Complex BSpline surface entity with empty knots/multiplicities
   Defect: a complex/AND-instance for a rational BSpline surface
   ((BOUNDED_SURFACE() B_SPLINE_SURFACE() B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS()
     ... RATIONAL_B_SPLINE_SURFACE() ...)) carries empty KNOTS()/
   KNOT_MULTIPLICITIES() lists, plus an empty representation-item name.
   OCCT readers historically null-deref'd here (Mantis 0029478,
   commit 5dd92c3). The reader should reject the surface and skip the host
   face, emitting a per-entity diagnostic, and continue. */
